    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>p</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Both the particles will move with momentum same in magnitude and opposite in direction.</p><p>So de Broglie wavelength of both will be same, i.e., ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>",
